<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Hewlett-Packard cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Hewlett-Packard cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said it downgraded Hewlett-Packard Co to market underperform from market perform.</p>
<p>-- After the market closed on Thursday, Hewlett-Packard said it earned $0.75 a share in the second quarter ended April 30, falling short of analysts' consensus estimate of $0.80 a share, according to First Call.</p>
<p>-- Hewlett-Packard closed Thursday at 58-7/8.</p>
</text>
